    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><u>CASTASIDE</u></strong></i> is an <strong><i>Action Adventure RPG</i></strong> that is evocative of games from the fourth generation of consoles, but pushed into the modern era! Take control of a Beastian, a human-like monster capable of dashing across ledges and deft sword swipes as you uncover the mysteries of the last bastion of human civilization.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate between <strong><i>relaxing overworld exploration</i></strong> and <strong><i>chaotic arcady action</i></strong> as you perform deceptively simple moves that will help you excel at both! Master the moves only a Beastian can perform to take on the world and whatever challenges that stand against you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you will meet a colorful cast of characters, obtain weapons and abilities that change the way you play, and find many off the beaten path secrets!... (hopefully)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore</i></strong><i> an exotic environment with a wide array of movement-based abilities!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Customize</i></strong><i> your experience by altering your stats and equipping an arsenal of weapons!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Freeze time</i></strong><i> in battles to catch your breath in frenetic top down Action RPG Combat!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A <strong>Retro Aesthetic</strong> with design conveniences and fluidity found in the modern day!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587800/extras/d3951fefbdf08f535f7777a1937c022b.poster.avif?t=1747166489\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587800/extras/d3951fefbdf08f535f7777a1937c022b.webp?t=1747166489\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><u>CASTASIDE</u></strong></i> is an <strong><i>Action Adventure RPG</i></strong> that is evocative of games from the fourth generation of consoles, but pushed into the modern era! Take control of a Beastian, a human-like monster capable of dashing across ledges and deft sword swipes as you uncover the mysteries of the last bastion of human civilization.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate between <strong><i>relaxing overworld exploration</i></strong> and <strong><i>chaotic arcady action</i></strong> as you perform deceptively simple moves that will help you excel at both! Master the moves only a Beastian can perform to take on the world and whatever challenges that stand against you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you will meet a colorful cast of characters, obtain weapons and abilities that change the way you play, and find many off the beaten path secrets!... (hopefully)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore</i></strong><i> an exotic environment with a wide array of movement-based abilities!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Customize</i></strong><i> your experience by altering your stats and equipping an arsenal of weapons!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Freeze time</i></strong><i> in battles to catch your breath in frenetic top down Action RPG Combat!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A <strong>Retro Aesthetic</strong> with design conveniences and fluidity found in the modern day!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587800/extras/d3951fefbdf08f535f7777a1937c022b.poster.avif?t=1747166489\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587800/extras/d3951fefbdf08f535f7777a1937c022b.webp?t=1747166489\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
